#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:8
msgid "接收与运行时工作预算"
msgstr "Bounded Receive and Runtime Work"

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:10
msgid ""
"`XGL_ENABLE_ADVANCED_RUNTIME=ON` 启用可续跑的接收校验和 `<xgl/xgl_runtime.h>` 的 `xgl_step_bounded()`。这是显式构建选项，所有 "
"profile 默认均为 OFF。关闭时保留 原 parser 布局，有界入口返回 `XGL_ERR_UNSUPPORTED`。库和消费者必须使用一致的 选项，以生成的构建配置为准。"
msgstr ""
"`XGL_ENABLE_ADVANCED_RUNTIME=ON` enables resumable receive validation and `xgl_step_bounded()` from "
"`<xgl/xgl_runtime.h>`. Every profile defaults to OFF. When disabled, the parser keeps its ordinary "
"layout and the bounded entry returns `XGL_ERR_UNSUPPORTED`. The library and consumer must agree with the"
" generated build configuration."

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:15
msgid "预算计量对象"
msgstr "What the Limits Count"

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:17
msgid "已有 `xgl_work_budget_t` 控制每个 PHY 新读取的字节数和 parser 超时。 `xgl_execution_limits_t` 补充两个独立上限："
msgstr ""
"The existing `xgl_work_budget_t` controls newly read bytes per PHY and the parser timeout. "
"`xgl_execution_limits_t` adds two independent limits:"

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:0
msgid "字段"
msgstr "Field"

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:0
msgid "范围和含义"
msgstr "Scope and meaning"

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:0
msgid "`parser_candidates`"
msgstr "`parser_candidates`"

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:0
msgid "每条链路、每次 step 的校验机会数"
msgstr "Validation opportunities per link in one step"

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:0
msgid "`tx_packets`"
msgstr "`tx_packets`"

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:0
msgid "整个 transport 维护阶段、每次 step 的报文提交尝试次数"
msgstr "Packet submission attempts across transport maintenance in one step"

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:25
msgid ""
"零禁止对应工作，`SIZE_MAX` 取消该项限制。定时维护仍执行。新输入字节使固定头、 扩展块或完整帧达到可检查状态时扣除一个 parser 配额；一次检查可以完成多个校验 "
"阶段。恢复扫描中，每次候选检查扣除一个配额；扫描结束后恢复最早半帧，也需要 一次检查。扫描噪声和推进已消费的存储不消耗配额。"
msgstr ""
"Zero prohibits the corresponding work; `SIZE_MAX` removes that limit. Timers still run. A parser token "
"is charged when an incoming byte makes a fixed header, extension block or complete frame ready for "
"inspection. One inspection can complete more than one validation stage. During recovery, each candidate "
"inspection consumes a token; restoring the earliest incomplete candidate after the scan also consumes "
"one. Noise scanning and advancing already consumed storage do not require a token."

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:30
msgid ""
"这里限制校验尝试次数，不限制 CRC 字节数或 CPU 周期。单次检查仍可能校验整个 帧。PHY 回调、认证 provider、应用回调、内存移动和扫描均有执行成本。接收触发的 ACK "
"和应用显式发送不受维护阶段 TX 配额限制。产品应包含这些成本，测量完整 step 的最坏执行时间。"
msgstr ""
"This bounds the number of validation attempts, not CRC bytes or processor cycles. A single inspection "
"can checksum a complete frame. PHY callbacks, authentication providers, application callbacks, memory "
"moves and scans still take time. Receive-triggered ACKs and explicit application sends are outside the "
"maintenance TX limit. Measure whole-step worst-case execution time on the product, including these "
"costs."

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:35
msgid "有界维护在处理到期重传时按 peer 轮换起点，为各 peer 提供提交机会。 回调耗时、驱动背压和实际服务时延仍需产品验证。"
msgstr ""
"Bounded maintenance rotates its starting peer when processing due retries. Rotation gives peers "
"opportunities to submit work. Validate callback cost, driver backpressure and actual service latency on "
"the product."

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:38
msgid "续跑与输入所有权"
msgstr "Continuation and Input Ownership"

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:40
msgid ""
"有界 step 返回首个处理错误，并独立写入 `result.pending`，调用方应同时检查。 `pending` 表示配额阻止本地可执行工作完成，不表示猜测驱动中可能还有未读字节。 应由同一个串行 "
"owner 使用正配额续跑。应用交付返回 BUSY 时，需要应用容量恢复 事件，不能用紧密循环不断重试。"
msgstr ""
"The bounded step returns its first processing error and independently writes `result.pending`. Check "
"both. `pending` means that executable local work remains because a limit prevented completion; it does "
"not mean that the driver might have unread bytes. Retry with positive limits through the same serialized"
" owner. An application delivery that returned BUSY needs an application-capacity event, not a tight "
"retry loop."

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:45
msgid ""
"接收路径复用原 parser cache，同时保存正在解析的候选和本次读入但尚未处理的 尾部。PHY 只写入暴露的空闲 cache，每次 poll 最多读取一次。所有已接纳字节在 "
"返回前均已处理或持久保留。恢复暂停不会把未读尾部留在临时栈数组，也不会新增 一个 MTU 大小的缓冲区。"
msgstr ""
"For RX, the existing parser cache holds both the candidate being parsed and the unprocessed tail of the "
"last read. The PHY writes only into exposed free cache space, at most once per poll. Every accepted byte"
" is either processed or retained before returning. A paused recovery never leaves unread bytes in a "
"temporary stack buffer, and does not allocate another MTU-sized buffer."

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:50
msgid ""
"内部 span 入口返回 `consumed`，可能小于提供的长度。调用方必须保留并准确重传 未消费后缀，已消费前缀的副本归 parser 管理。输入不能与 parser 存储重叠。 产品通常使用公开 "
"step API 和同步 PHY 契约，无需调用这个私有函数。"
msgstr ""
"The private span ingress reports `consumed`, which may be less than the supplied length. The caller must"
" retain and later resubmit exactly the unconsumed suffix; the parser owns a copy of the consumed prefix."
" Its input must not overlap parser storage. Product integrations normally use the public step API and "
"synchronous PHY contract rather than this private function."

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:54
msgid ""
"解码后的帧 view 借用 parser 存储。同步交付完成后，parser 才能压缩或覆盖该 存储。回调要保存后续使用的数据时必须复制，不得重入、重置或销毁实例。即使上层 拒收，完整且 wire "
"合法的帧仍被消费，其 payload 不会被解释为新候选。"
msgstr ""
"A decoded frame view borrows parser storage. Delivery finishes synchronously before the parser compacts "
"or overwrites that storage. Callbacks must copy data they need afterwards and must not reenter, reset or"
" destroy the instance. An upper-layer rejection still consumes the complete wire-valid frame; its "
"payload is not interpreted as another candidate."

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:58
msgid ""
"`rx_bytes=0` 禁止新的 PHY 读取，仍可推进已保留的 parser 工作和 transport 维护。启用 ADVANCED_RUNTIME 后，普通 `xgl_step()` "
"以无限候选和维护配额排空 同一份状态，因此两种入口交替使用不会丢失输入；切换回普通入口也会取消这些 工作限制。"
msgstr ""
"`rx_bytes=0` prevents new PHY reads while allowing retained parser work and transport maintenance to "
"advance. With ADVANCED_RUNTIME enabled, ordinary `xgl_step()` drains the same retained state with "
"unlimited candidate and maintenance quotas. Switching between the two entries therefore does not discard"
" input; switching to the ordinary entry also removes these work limits."

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:63
msgid "恢复与时间"
msgstr "Recovery and Time"

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:65
msgid ""
"拒绝一个帧后，恢复扫描检查后续 magic 位置，优先选择最早的完整合法帧；没有 完整帧时，保留最早可能成立的半帧。预算耗尽会保存扫描游标和半帧位置，续跑 "
"不需要从被拒绝的头部重新扫描。扫描中的失败候选不会重复报告原始 CRC 错误。"
msgstr ""
"After rejection, recovery examines later magic positions, preferring the earliest complete valid frame. "
"If none is complete, it retains the earliest possible partial frame. Budget exhaustion preserves the "
"scan cursor and that partial candidate across calls, so resumption does not restart the scan from the "
"rejected header. Rejected scan candidates do not repeatedly report the original CRC failure."

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:69
msgid ""
"保留后缀保守地继承原候选的起始时间。未处理输入批次中新开始的候选使用该批次 读入时刻，不使用较晚的续跑时刻。预算暂停不会刷新已有帧的绝对截止时间。 Parser "
"超时或重置会同时清除恢复状态和保留的输入批次，这是明确的丢弃边界。"
msgstr ""
"Retained suffixes conservatively keep the original candidate start time. A newly started candidate in an"
" unread input batch uses that batch's read timestamp, not the later time when the work resumes. Budget "
"suspension never refreshes an existing frame's absolute deadline. Parser expiry or reset clears both "
"recovery state and the retained input batch; this is an intentional discard boundary."

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:73
msgid ""
"所有操作使用同一个单调毫秒时钟，时间间隔小于 `2^31` 毫秒。接收超时为零时关闭 到期清理；候选和 RX 配额均为零时仍执行超时维护。策略和截止时间查询详见 [低功耗运行时](../guides/low-"
"power.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Use the same monotonic millisecond clock for every operation and keep intervals below `2^31` "
"milliseconds. Zero receive timeout disables expiry. Timeout maintenance runs even with zero candidate "
"and RX quotas. See [low-power runtime](../guides/low-power.md) for policy and deadline queries."

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:77
msgid "轮询与吞吐"
msgstr "Polling and Throughput"

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:79
msgid "对于到期链路，一次 PHY 读取最多接纳："
msgstr "For a due link, one PHY read can accept at most:"

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:85
msgid ""
"若每 `T` 秒读取一次，`B / T` 是以字节/秒表示的理想接收上限，不是服务速率保证。 恢复暂停、驱动短读、候选配额不足和 cache 占用都会进一步降低吞吐。当配额充足且 `B` 恒定时，长度为 "
"`L` 的帧至少需要 `ceil(L / B)` 次读取。RX 事件不会绕过 已经配置的 PHY 轮询间隔。 只有实际调用 PHY RX 才会推进该间隔，驱动返回错误也计入一次轮询。仅续跑 暂停的 "
"parser 而未读取 PHY 时，不会延后下一次允许读取的时刻。"
msgstr ""
"If reads occur every `T` seconds, `B / T` is an ideal upper bound on ingress throughput in bytes/second,"
" not a guaranteed service rate. Recovery pauses, partial reads, insufficient candidate quotas and "
"occupied cache space reduce it. With enough tokens, a frame of `L` bytes needs at least `ceil(L / B)` "
"reads when `B` is constant. An RX event does not bypass a configured PHY polling interval. Only an "
"actual PHY RX invocation advances that interval, including a driver error. Resuming a paused parser "
"without reading the PHY does not postpone the next permitted read."

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:92
msgid ""
"例如每 1 ms 轮询、chunk 为 32 字节时，忽略解析、调度和驱动成本的读取上限为 32,000 字节/秒。把 `rx_bytes` 增加到 32 以上不会增大该构建的 chunk。驱动环形 "
"缓冲应覆盖真实突发和 owner task 最长服务间隔；parser 超时应允许接收并检查 最大合法帧所需的时间。"
msgstr ""
"For example, a 32-byte chunk polled every 1 ms has a 32,000 byte/s read ceiling before parser, "
"scheduling and driver costs. Increasing `rx_bytes` above 32 does not increase that build's chunk size. "
"Size the driver ring for the actual burst and longest owner-task service gap; validate the parser "
"timeout against the time needed to receive and inspect the largest permitted frame."

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:97
msgid "DMA 与 Owner Task 接入"
msgstr "DMA and Owner-Task Integration"

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:99
msgid "DMA 所有权由板级驱动维护，常见路径为："
msgstr "DMA ownership remains in the board driver. A typical path is:"

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:106
msgid ""
"DMA ISR 记录生产进度并唤醒 owner，不调用协议 API。驱动必须结合真实平台处理 回绕、DMA 缓存一致性、生产进度发布和覆盖检测。PHY RX 只把稳定可用的字节复制 "
"到传入缓冲，返回实际长度，不能保留该指针。RX 返回后 parser 存储可能立即移动， 不能作为长期 DMA 目标地址。另见[移植指南](../guides/porting.md)。"
msgstr ""
"The DMA ISR records producer progress and wakes the owner; it never calls the protocol API. The driver "
"must handle wrap, DMA cache coherency, publication of producer progress, and overwrite detection for its"
" actual platform. PHY RX copies only stable available bytes into the supplied buffer, returns the actual"
" count, and never retains that pointer. Parser storage can move immediately after RX returns and is not "
"a persistent DMA destination. See [porting](../guides/porting.md)."

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:111
msgid "以下 owner 单次迭代展示控制流程。所有 `product_*` 函数均为产品提供的适配占位符， 不是 SDK API，也不代表已经通过验证的板级适配："
msgstr ""
"The following owner iteration illustrates control flow. Every `product_*` function is a product-supplied"
" placeholder, not an SDK API or a verified board adapter:"

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:133
msgid ""
"调度必须给其他产品工作执行机会。事件注册和等待应避免竞态，容量恢复通知也应 唤醒同一个 owner。若某项配额持续为零且存在 pending，需要修改策略或等待外部 "
"事件；反复使用相同的零配额调度不能排空这些工作。"
msgstr ""
"Scheduling must give other product work an opportunity to run. Registering an event and waiting must be "
"race-safe, and capacity notifications must wake the same owner. A zero configured quota with persistent "
"pending work requires a policy change or external event; repeatedly scheduling the same zero quota "
"cannot drain it."

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:137
msgid "验证范围"
msgstr "Validation Scope"

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:139
msgid ""
"主机回归覆盖所有输入切分位置、随机 chunk 和配额（seed `5785420`）、嵌套候选、 最早半帧恢复、源缓冲被修改后的输入保留、cache 容量、超时/重置和切回普通接收 "
"入口，并检查特性开启及关闭两种 parser 配置。这些测试验证字节守恒与状态机行为， 不构成板级吞吐、DMA 正确性或最坏时延结论。"
msgstr ""
"Host regression covers all input split points, randomized chunks and quotas (seed `5785420`), nested "
"candidates, earliest-partial restoration, retained input after source-buffer mutation, cache capacity, "
"timeout/reset and switching to the ordinary receive path. Both enabled and disabled parser "
"configurations are checked. These tests validate byte conservation and state-machine behavior; they do "
"not establish board throughput, DMA correctness or worst-case latency."

#: docs/zh/explanation/runtime.md:144
msgid ""
"产品验收还应覆盖持续输入、密集损坏数据、驱动环形缓冲溢出、长回调、DMA 回绕 和缓存操作、时钟回绕以及多条活动链路的公平性。记录所选特性/profile 组合的 完整镜像 Flash、RAM 和栈测量结果。"
msgstr ""
"Product acceptance must additionally exercise sustained input, corruption bursts, driver-ring overflow, "
"long callback execution, DMA wrap and cache operations, clock wrap, and fairness with several active "
"links. Record the complete image's Flash, RAM and stack measurements for the selected feature/profile "
"combination."
